# API Integration

## Base URL

Backend API base URL: `http://localhost:8000`

For production, use environment variable:

```typescript
const API_BASE_URL = import.meta.env.VITE_API_URL || 'http://localhost:8000'
```

## Fetch Pattern

Use async/await for API calls:

```typescript
const fetchData = async () => {
  try {
    const response = await fetch(`${API_BASE_URL}/api/endpoint`)
    if (!response.ok) {
      throw new Error(`HTTP error! status: ${response.status}`)
    }
    const data = await response.json()
    return data
  } catch (error) {
    console.error('API error:', error)
    throw error
  }
}
```

## POST Requests

```typescript
const postData = async (payload: RequestData) => {
  const response = await fetch(`${API_BASE_URL}/api/endpoint`, {
    method: 'POST',
    headers: {
      'Content-Type': 'application/json',
    },
    body: JSON.stringify(payload),
  })
  return response.json()
}
```

## Error Handling

Always handle errors gracefully:

```typescript
const [error, setError] = useState<string | null>(null)

try {
  const data = await fetchData()
  setData(data)
  setError(null)
} catch (err) {
  const message = err instanceof Error ? err.message : 'Unknown error'
  setError(message)
  // Show user-friendly error message
}
```

## Loading States

Show loading indicators during API calls:

```typescript
const [loading, setLoading] = useState(false)

const loadData = async () => {
  setLoading(true)
  try {
    const data = await fetchData()
    setData(data)
  } finally {
    setLoading(false)
  }
}
```

## User Feedback

Provide feedback for user actions:

```typescript
// Success
if (response.ok) {
  // Show success message or update UI
}

// Error
if (!response.ok) {
  // Show error message to user
  alert('Failed to save data. Please try again.')
}
```

## Common Endpoints

- `/api/tables` - List available machine groups
- `/api/data` - Get sensor data
- `/api/visualization/analytics` - Get analytics data
- `/api/agent/chat` - DQA Agent chat endpoint
- `/api/import/upload` - Data import endpoint
